'''Safari Essence''' is an [[Essence]]. It is primarily used on {{Zone|Torrhus Canyon}} and the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Obtaining ==
'''Safari Essence''' can be be obtained in the {{Zone|Critter Safari}} by catching [[Critters]] and finding [[Floor Drops]].

