== Usage ==
=== Essence Shop ===
{{:Essence Shops/Safari}}
A total of {{Item|Safari Essence|amount=50,850}} is required to fully purchase everything available in the essence shop, including {{Item|Morning Dew}}, costing {{BZC|50,850 Safari Essence}}.

